---
import Verticalgrid from "../assets/Verticalgrid.astro";
---

<section class="relative border-t border-y border-white/5">
  <div class="relative px-8 py-12 mx-auto max-w-7xl md:px-12 lg:px-32 lg:py-[72px]">
    <div class="text-center max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <h2 class="text-balance">Easy Omnichannel Experience for Salesforce
      </h2>
        <p class="max-w-4xl mt-4">
          99minds is ideal for omnichannel Salesforce users. Seamlessly deploy your marketing strategy across all your locations by integrating with your Point-of-Sale and eCommerce systems. It's designed to simplify your operations, enhance your sales, and save you significant time.
        </p>
    </div>
    <div class="relative  items-center lg:w-2/3 pb-0 mx-auto overflow-hidden max-w-7xl">
        <img
          class="object-cover justify-center mx-auto"
          loading="lazy"
          src="/assets/salesforce/Salesforce-int1.svg" width="1080" height="855"
          alt="99minds integrations for salesforce"
        />
      </div>
  </div>
</section>